4. `Σ_{pq} C^a_{pq} k^p k^q = 0`, `Σ_a C^a_{aq} = 0` (trace of the **difference** connection);
5. `accel g gi k = accel b bi k`, hence actual pregeodesic / affine conditions are equivalent
